  "This goes to the model your server is set up to use, with your %@ message. No other photo in this chat does.": "它会连同你带有 %@ 的消息一起发送给你的服务器所用的模型。这个聊天里的其他照片都不会。",
  "This goes to the model your server is set up to use, with your question. Nothing else from this chat does.": "它会连同你的问题一起发送给你的服务器所用的模型。这个聊天里的其他内容都不会。",
  "This happens immediately and cannot be undone.": "这会立即执行，而且无法撤销。",
  "This names your family chat too. 1–64 characters.": "这也会作为家庭对话的名称。1–64 个字符。",
