  "Turn on Can be shown photos first — the server refuses this while that is off.": "请先打开“可以看照片”——它关闭时，服务器会拒绝这项设置。",
  "Type your password to confirm it is you. Being signed in is not proof.": "输入你的密码来确认是你本人。已经登录并不能作为证明。",
