  "Up to %lld of the most recent photos in this chat go to the model your server is set up to use, with your %@ message — pictures nobody pointed it at, whoever sent them.": "这个聊天里最近的照片最多 %lld 张会连同你带有 %@ 的消息一起发送给你的服务器所用的模型——没有人指给它看的图片，无论是谁发的。",
  "Up to %lld of the most recent photos in this chat may still go.": "这个聊天里最近的照片仍可能发送，最多 %lld 张。",
  "Use at least %lld characters.": "至少使用 %lld 个字符。",
  "Username": "用户名",
  "Usernames are 3–32 letters, digits, dots or underscores. Passwords need at least 8 characters.": "用户名为 3–32 个字母、数字、点或下划线。密码至少 8 个字符。",
