  "Wait until the current attachment is done.": "请等当前附件处理完。",
  "Waiting for approval": "等待批准",
  "Welcome Back": "欢迎回来",
  "What happens": "会发生什么",
  "When": "时间",
  "Where": "地点",
  "While Sees recent history is off this does nothing: no names are sent, so no faces are either.": "在“查看最近的历史记录”关闭时，此项不起作用：不发送姓名，也就不发送面孔。",
  "While Sees recent history is off this does nothing: the chat's history isn't sent, so no photo from it is either.": "“查看最近的历史记录”关闭时，这项设置不起作用：聊天历史不会发送，其中的照片自然也不会。",
  "Who sends what": "谁发了什么",
  "Why are you reporting %@?": "你为什么要举报 %@？",
  "With approval, join requests wait here until you approve them.": "启用批准后，加入申请会留在这里等你批准。",
  "With this on, a photo is sent to the model your server is set up to use when a member attaches it to a question in their own chat with the assistant, attaches it to an %@ message in the family chat, or replies to a photo with %@ — never a photo the assistant was not pointed at, never from an earlier message unless Recent photos is on, and never a video, file or place. With it off, no photo is ever sent.": "打开后，当家里的某人在自己与助手的聊天中给问题附上照片、在家庭聊天中给带有 %@ 的消息附上照片，或用 %@ 回复一张照片时，这张照片会发送给你的服务器所用的模型——绝不会发送没有指给助手看的照片，除非打开了“最近的照片”，否则绝不会来自更早的消息，也绝不会发送视频、文件或位置。关闭时，任何照片都不会被发送。",
  "With this on, mentioning %@ in the family chat sends the last month of that chat to the assistant, so it can answer questions about what was said earlier. With it off, only the message that mentions it is sent.": "打开后，在家庭对话里提到 %@ 时，会把这个对话最近一个月的内容一起发给助手，它就能回答之前说过的事。关闭后，只发送提到它的那条消息。",
  "With this on, the assistant posts one short good-morning message into the family chat each day, mentioning the star signs of the birthdays your family has set. It never sends anyone's name or birth date, only the signs; it makes no claims about the date; and it never sounds a notification — it is simply there when you next open the chat.": "打开后，助手每天都会在家庭聊天中发一条简短的早安消息，并提到家人已填写的生日对应的星座。它从不发送任何人的姓名或出生日期，只发送星座；它不会对日期作出任何断言；它也从不发出通知——下次你打开聊天时它就在那里。",
  "With this on, whenever anyone mentions %@ in the family chat, the most recent photos in that chat — up to %lld, from anyone, that nobody pointed the assistant at — also go to the model your server is set up to use, after any photo on the message itself or on the one it replies to. Nearly every mention then sends pictures, which costs more. It is off unless you turn it on.": "打开后，每当有人在家庭聊天里提到 %@，这个聊天里最近的照片——最多 %lld 张，来自任何人，没有指给助手看的——也会在消息本身或它所回复的消息上的照片之后，发送给你的服务器所用的模型。此后几乎每次提到它都会发送图片，费用更高。默认关闭，除非你打开它。",
  "With this on, whenever anyone mentions %@ in the family chat, the profile pictures of the members named in that chat's recent history — up to %lld — also go to the model your server is set up to use, so it can tell who is who. They are the pictures members chose for themselves, not photos anyone attached; never a member who has left, and never anyone outside this family. Most mentions then send pictures, which costs more. It is off unless you turn it on; with it off, no face is ever sent.": "打开后，每当有人在家庭聊天中提到 %@，该聊天近期记录中提到的成员的头像（最多 %lld 张）也会发送给你的服务器所使用的模型，以便它分清谁是谁。这些是成员为自己选择的图片，而不是任何人附加的照片；从不发送已离开成员或本家庭之外任何人的头像。此后大多数提及都会发送图片，费用更高。除非你打开，否则处于关闭状态；关闭时绝不会发送任何面孔。",
  "Words only": "只有文字",
  "Written by %@": "由 %@ 写下",
  "Wrong username or password.": "用户名或密码不正确。",
  "Yesterday": "昨天",
  "You": "你",
  "You already have a pending request.": "你已有一个待处理的请求。",
  "You can attach up to %lld items.": "最多只能附加%lld个项目。",
  "You own this family: ownership passes to the longest-standing remaining member. If you are its last member, the family is deleted with you — its chat, its board and its invite code.": "这个家庭是你的：它会转给待得最久的成员。如果你是最后一位成员，家庭会随你一起被删除——它的对话、留言板和邀请码。",
  "You'll lose access to the family chat and your direct chats. Your history returns if you rejoin.": "你将失去家庭对话和单独对话的访问权限。如果重新加入，历史记录会回来。",
  "You're already in a family.": "你已经加入了一个家庭。",
  "You're the only member left. Leaving deletes the family and everything in it.": "你是最后一名成员。离开将删除这个家庭及其中的所有内容。",
  "Your account, password, profile picture and birthday are deleted, and every device you are signed in on is signed out.": "你的账户、密码、头像和生日都会被删除，所有已登录的设备都会退出登录。",
  "Your choice": "你的选择",
  "Your direct chats are deleted — for the other person too. So is your private chat with the assistant.": "你的单独对话会被删除，对方那边也一样。和助手的私人对话同样会被删除。",
  "Your event": "你的活动",
  "Your family owner will be told you reported this member.": "你家庭的所有者将获知你举报了该成员。",
